  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Range
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: "The <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color><color=#D4D4D4>()</color></font>
    function can also receive parameters to control the generated sequence of numbers.\n\nExamples:\n<indent=2em>-
    <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color><color=#D4D4D4\">(</color><color=#B5CEA8>5</color><color=#D4D4D4\">)</color></font>
    \u2192 Generate numbers from <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>0</color></font>
    to <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>4</color></font></indent>\n<indent=2em>-
    <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color><color=#D4D4D4\">(</color><color=#B5CEA8>2</color><color=#D4D4D4\">,</color>
    <color=#B5CEA8>5</color><color=#D4D4D4\">)</color></font> \u2192 Generate numbers
    from <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>2</color></font> to <font=\"JetBrainsMono
    SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>4</color></font></indent>\n<indent=2em>- <font=\"JetBrainsMono
    SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color><color=#D4D4D4\">(</color><color=#B5CEA8>0</color><color=#D4D4D4\">,</color>
    <color=#B5CEA8>10</color><color=#D4D4D4\">,</color> <color=#B5CEA8>2</color><color=#D4D4D4\">)</color></font>
    \u2192 Generate numbers from <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>0</color></font>
    to <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>8</color></font> with a step of
    <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>2</color></font></indent>\n\nThe parameters
    are commonly interpreted as:\n<indent=2em>- Start value</indent>\n<indent=2em>-
    End value</indent>\n<indent=2em>- Step value</indent>\n\nThese parameters allow
    loops to repeat in more flexible ways."
  isImageBig: 0
